abstract: >
  A production-grade Google Agent Development Kit (google-adk) framework implementing
  and evaluating A2UI v0.9 commercial user interface components (AdBanner and SponsoredCard).
  Integrates a real-time second-price Vickrey ad auction engine, deterministic callback hook
  injection, content-grounded educational gating, live SerpApi search ads retrieval,
  multi-turn SSE token streaming, and automated API quota governance.
